[
  {"comment":"SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Flat Pattern DXF export (mitcad#210) of the contract L (t=2, r=3, K=0.3, 90 degrees, width 20, planar lengths 30 and 15) with a 4 mm hole in the base: the drawing's contours, bend line, layers and units read back from the file, then rule edits of K, thickness and radius change the drawing. Flat length = (35 - (r+t)) + BA + 15 with BA = (pi/2)(r + K t)."},
